625
00:35:19.325 --> 00:35:20.201
Tetap bertahan.

626
00:35:20.785 --> 00:35:22.120
Mereka berhasil menangkapku.

627
00:35:23.204 --> 00:35:24.372
Seung-yeon, pegang aku erat-erat.

628
